        ['q' => 'How long do I have to file a TWIA claim?', 'a' => '<p>A TWIA claim must be filed no later than one year after the date the damage occurred. The insurance commissioner may extend that by up to 180 days for good cause. Do not wait: evidence is easier to gather soon after a storm.</p>'],
